{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3141","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3141","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3141\",\"parent_revision\":\"891a307642569f81f91f7a503555fe4123eee782db70e5f2a883203b373f3e07\",\"root_revision\":\"891a307642569f81f91f7a503555fe4123eee782db70e5f2a883203b373f3e07\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P2\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-08-22\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nBoth `dh:dh-context-gathering` and `dh:context-refinement` advertise in their frontmatter descriptions that the caller should pass a task file path so the agent can read the task file and update it directly. Their bodies forbid using file-editing tools on that path and route all task reads and writes through the SAM plan and task operations.\\n\\nA description is what a dispatching agent reads when choosing an agent and composing its prompt. So the dispatcher is told to hand over a filesystem path for direct editing, and the dispatched agent then finds itself instructed not to do that. The dispatcher has no way to see the contradiction before dispatching.\\n\\nImpact: the two agents share template ancestry, so this is a systemic defect in that template rather than two independent typos. Other agents derived from the same template may carry it.\\n\\nPayoff: descriptions that match behaviour let a dispatcher construct a correct prompt on the first attempt instead of relying on the dispatched agent to notice and reinterpret the instruction.\\n\\nReproduction: read the `description` frontmatter of both agents under plugins/development-harness/agents/, then read each body's instructions about the task file path.\\n\\n## Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- [ ] Work matches description\\n- [ ] Plan or implementation complete\\n</div>\\n\\n## Story\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\nAs a **developer relying on this plugin**, I want to **dh-context-gathering and context-refinement descriptions contradict their own bodies** so that **the tool works correctly and reliably**.\\n</div>\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Agent-definition survey, 2026-08-22\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-08-22\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"37e2ae5addecde76e4587367a8c7136c2cdde42d73143e9e90ade0c77f78cef1\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABQLLhxg\"}"}